          "content": {
            "content_type": "text",
            "parts": [
              "The full-space calculation preserves the exponential phase, and the \\(1/16\\) comes from a surface term on the unit sphere. The working note now includes the expanded kernels and the derivation of that term. The manuscript remains unchanged."
            ]
